#: modules/comments-off/module.php
msgctxt "module description"
msgid ""
"Turns comments off everywhere: closed on every post, no Comments menu, "
"dashboard widget or toolbar item, no comment blocks on the site and no "
"comment feeds."
msgstr ""
"Desactiva els comentaris a tot el web: tancats a totes les entrades, sense "
"el menú Comentaris, el giny del tauler ni l'element de la barra d'eines, "
"sense blocs de comentaris al web i sense canals de comentaris."

#: modules/comments-off/module.php:147
msgid "Comments are closed."
msgstr "Els comentaris estan tancats."

