#: modules/matomo/includes/class-admin-fields.php:67
msgid "Cookies"
msgstr "Galetes"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:84
msgid "Sorry, you are not allowed to do that."
msgstr "No tens permís per fer això."

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:144
#: modules/forms/includes/admin/class-submissions-table.php:115
msgid "Pending"
msgstr "Pendent"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:145
msgid "Confirmed"
msgstr "Confirmada"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:146
msgid "Ignored"
msgstr "Ignorada"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:173
msgid "Changes saved."
msgstr "S'han desat els canvis."

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:173
msgid "Cookie deleted."
msgstr "S'ha suprimit la galeta."

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:175
msgid ""
"Not saved: check the cookie name (exact name, or a prefix ending in *) and "
"that the list is not full."
msgstr ""
"No s'ha desat: revisa el nom de la galeta (el nom exacte, o un prefix acabat "
"en *) i que la llista no estigui plena."

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:178
msgid ""
"The active theme brings its own cookie notice: these settings do not apply "
"to it."
msgstr ""
"El tema actiu porta el seu propi avís de galetes: aquests paràmetres no s'hi "
"apliquen."

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:181
msgid "Cookie notice"
msgstr "Avís de galetes"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:186
msgid "Categories the notice asks about"
msgstr "Categories per les quals pregunta l'avís"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:195
msgid "declared by the code (theme or a module)"
msgstr "la declara el codi (el tema o un mòdul)"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:200
msgid ""
"Changing the categories shows the notice again to every visitor: they are "
"being asked about something new. Without any category, the notice does not "
"appear."
msgstr ""
"Canviar les categories torna a mostrar l'avís a tots els visitants: se'ls "
"pregunta per una cosa nova. Sense cap categoria, l'avís no surt."

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:204
msgid "Cookie detector"
msgstr "Detector de galetes"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:208
msgid ""
"When a visitor accepts cookies, their browser sends the NAMES (never the "
"values) of the cookies it sees on this site, at most once a week or when the "
"list changes. New names appear below as pending."
msgstr ""
"Quan un visitant accepta les galetes, el seu navegador envia els NOMS (mai "
"els valors) de les galetes que veu en aquest web, com a màxim un cop per "
"setmana o quan canvia la llista. Els noms nous surten a sota com a pendents."

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:213
msgid "Save notice settings"
msgstr "Desa els paràmetres de l'avís"

#. translators: 1: category name, 2: list of cookie names.
#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:229
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The notice does not ask about «%1$s», but these confirmed cookies belong to "
"it: %2$s. Either the notice should ask about it (above), or the cookies "
"should not be set."
msgstr ""
"L'avís no pregunta per «%1$s», però aquestes galetes confirmades són "
"d'aquesta categoria: %2$s. O l'avís pregunta per ella (a dalt), o aquestes "
"galetes no s'haurien de posar."

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:237
msgid "Cookies of this site"
msgstr "Galetes d'aquest web"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:238
msgid ""
"Only confirmed cookies appear in the cookie table of the policy (block "
"«Cookie table» or shortcode [estrategia_web_cookie_table]). Proposals come "
"from our own list and from the Open Cookie Database: check them. A name "
"ending in * covers every cookie that starts like that."
msgstr ""
"Només les galetes confirmades surten a la taula de galetes de la política "
"(bloc «Taula de galetes» o codi curt [estrategia_web_cookie_table]). Les "
"propostes surten de la nostra llista i de l'Open Cookie Database: revisa-"
"les. Un nom acabat en * cobreix totes les galetes que comencen així."

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:239
msgid ""
"The cookies «Declared by the plugin» belong to third-party services that the "
"active modules load (the Google map, Google tags, Matomo): the detector "
"cannot see the ones set on the provider’s own domain, and sees the rest only "
"after a visitor accepts. To leave one out of the policy, mark it Ignored: if "
"you delete it, it comes back as a proposal while its module still loads the "
"service."
msgstr ""
"Les galetes marcades «Declarada pel plugin» són de serveis de tercers que "
"carreguen els mòduls actius (el mapa de Google, les etiquetes de Google, "
"Matomo): el detector no veu les que es posen al domini del mateix proveïdor, "
"i la resta només les veu quan un visitant accepta. Per deixar-ne una fora de "
"la política, marca-la com a Ignorada: si la suprimeixes, torna com a "
"proposta mentre el seu mòdul continuï carregant el servei."

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:243
msgid "Confirm all pending proposals"
msgstr "Confirma totes les propostes pendents"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:249
#: modules/consent/includes/class-cookie-table.php:163
msgid "Cookie"
msgstr "Galeta"

