msgstr "Finalitat"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:254
#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:330
#: modules/consent/includes/class-cookie-table.php:166
msgid "Duration"
msgstr "Durada"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:255
