msgstr "Vista"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:256
msgid "Actions"
msgstr "Accions"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:261
msgid ""
"No cookies yet. They appear when a visitor accepts the notice, or add them "
"below."
msgstr ""
"Encara no hi ha galetes. Surten quan un visitant accepta l'avís, o afegeix-"
"les a sota."

#. translators: %s: a concrete cookie name.
#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:272
#, php-format
msgid "e.g. %s"
msgstr "p. ex. %s"

#. translators: %s: name of a third-party service, e.g. «Google Maps (map block)».
#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:291
#, php-format
msgid "Declared by the plugin: %s"
msgstr "Declarada pel plugin: %s"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:294
msgid ""
"Its module no longer loads this service: delete the cookie if the site does "
"not use it any more."
msgstr ""
"El seu mòdul ja no carrega aquest servei: suprimeix la galeta si el web ja "
"no l'usa."

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:299
msgid "Added by hand"
msgstr "Afegida a mà"

#: modules/consent/includes/admin/class-cookies-page.php:302
